isdiction -> server-side merge (gh api repos/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-1410/merges, commit d18b3813a99bdc8cfe188137fa06d32b74ee8148) -> diff-scope-verified via compare API (only src/apparel/facts.cljc + test/apparel/facts_test.clj touched) -> manifest/west.yml pin advanced 36b11b05f8c4 -> d18b3813a99b (fast-forward, verified by verify-west-pins), done from an isolated worktree batching 4 real-world-ingest-gap landings' pin-advances together.", :event/screened-out-false-positives "None this iteration.", :event/not-done-this-iteration "Part of a 4-catalog parallel batch (apparel/DEU, rolling-stock/DEU, coke/POL, staffing/KOR) -- see following entries.", :event/superproject-adr "adr-2607211900-cloud-itonami-actor-substrate-maturity-loop-charter", :event/seq 42, :event/at "2026-07-22T10:50:00Z"}
{:event/type :actor-substrate/iteration, :event/iteration 43, :event/axis :real-world-ingest-gap, :event/repo "cloud-itonami-isic-3020", :event/action "Added Germany (:DEU) as a 5th jurisdiction to rolling-stock.facts/catalog (was JPN/USA/GBR/FRA), second landing of the 4-catalog parallel batch. Citation: Eisenbahn-Bau- und Betriebsordnung (EBO) SS32 (Abnahme und Untersuchung der Fahrzeuge -- new railway vehicles may not enter service until accepted/approved per SS3 Abs.2, plus mandatory periodic recurring inspection at least every 6 years, extendable to 8 years if vehicle condition permits) and SS3 Abs.2 (naming the Eisenbahn-Bundesamt, or the competent Land authority for non-federal railways, as the approving body). Honestly left DEU without structural-integrity/braking-system/electrical-safety entries, mirroring France's own prior narrow scope, since the EBO sections actually read (SSSS19/22/25 cover axle loads/vehicle gauge, not manufacturing-safety standards) did not yield independently-citable sub-standards for those categories.", :event/verification "Both citations independently re-fetched and confirmed verbatim by the orchestrating session directly against gesetze-im-internet.de (plain HTML, HTTP 200) -- EBO SS32(1) exact text ('Neue Fahrzeuge durfen erst in Betrieb genommen werden, wenn sie abgenommen worden sind (SS 3 Abs. 2)') and SS3(2) exact text ('Genehmigungen, die in den Vorschriften dieser Verordnung unter Hinweis auf diesen Absatz vorgesehen sind, erteilen...') both matched precisely. clojure -M:test run in the child repo checkout before (32/89) and after (34/98) landing, both directly and independently in a SEPARATE fresh clone of merged main: 34 tests / 98 assertions, 0 failures in every run. Landed via agent-pushed branch add-germany-deu-jurisdiction-rolling-stock-facts -> server-side merge (gh api repos/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-3020/merges, commit d6284b4675b5a616c9157f258ef6766ea37d5366) -> diff-scope-verified via compare API (only src